{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/409f40987fa79bc6fbadd57ebe7f59a9.poster.avif?t=1771798325\" width=878 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/409f40987fa79bc6fbadd57ebe7f59a9.webm?t=1771798325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight in the shifting darkness</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a living, mysterious labyrinth where danger lurks in every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat which blends fast-paced <strong>hack\u2019n\u2019slash</strong> action with the weight and precision of <strong>souls-like</strong> games. All this served in classic <strong>roguelike</strong> fashion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/29030dbd9580eb91a266045224f9ee8c.webp?t=1771798325\" width=614 height=1 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/b29f63c97a8e379b6804c8e5a027c59a.poster.avif?t=1771798325\" width=878 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/b29f63c97a8e379b6804c8e5a027c59a.webm?t=1771798325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft your power</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gear, enchant weapons and make your artifacts more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into deep itemization systems - <strong>Caveshifter</strong> is designed around build variety, character customization and meaningful progression. Your inventory is limited to a weapon and two powerful trinkets, so... choose wisely and take good care of them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/29030dbd9580eb91a266045224f9ee8c.webp?t=1771798325\" width=614 height=1 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/2510738ec3d5342a7a71526bf5e1a0af.poster.avif?t=1771798325\" width=878 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/2510738ec3d5342a7a71526bf5e1a0af.webm?t=1771798325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft your... dungeons?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful runes to shift the path ahead. Choose your rewards, alter enemies, or summon new rooms. Embrace the Caves - decide if they oppose you or serve you.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/29030dbd9580eb91a266045224f9ee8c.webp?t=1771798325\" width=614 height=1 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/60382c019d284a7912337d87d415dab4.poster.avif?t=1771798325\" width=878 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/extras/60382c019d284a7912337d87d415dab4.webm?t=1771798325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the unknown</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different - new rooms, new choices, new rewards. Explore a large ever-changing network of caves and uncover all of its secrets. This game is built around <strong>replayability</strong> as a core design pillar.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2132310?t=1771798325","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2132310?t=1771798325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/6ae0e0bb38eb5466711f7a0e5d3cded65e94be68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771798325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2132310/6ae0e0bb38eb5466711f7a0e5d3cded65e94be68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771798325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Caveshifter uses pixelart, but there\u2019s some stylized gore. Enemies can explode into blood when they die or leave blood spatters when hit. Certain actions \u2014 like sacrificing your own health for power-ups \u2014 are shown in a bloody and/or ritualistic way. It\u2019s all pretty exaggerated and not realistic, but worth mentioning if you\u2019re sensitive to that kind of content."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2447500,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.aka